---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Playground" description="Explore dynamic maximal matching updates in an interactive Axiom simulation.">
  <section class="playground shell">
    <header class="playground__header">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Interactive model</p>
      <h1>See the invariant move.</h1>
      <p>Pause the stream, switch modes, or click nodes to add edges. The visualization is a browser simulation of the update story; use the Python package for measured algorithm behavior.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="playground__demo card" data-demo>
      <div class="playground__toolbar">
        <div class="demo__modes" data-demo-modes role="group" aria-label="Simulation mode">
          <button type="button" data-mode="basic" class="is-on" aria-pressed="true">Basic</button>
          <button type="button" data-mode="multilevel" aria-pressed="false">Multilevel</button>
        </div>
        <div class="playground__controls" role="group" aria-label="Demo controls">
          <button type="button" data-demo-play aria-pressed="true">Pause</button>
          <button type="button" data-demo-shuffle>New graph</button>
          <button type="button" data-demo-reset>Reset</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="playground__canvas-wrap"><canvas data-demo-canvas tabindex="0" aria-label="Interactive graph visualization. Use arrow keys to select a node and Enter to toggle an edge."></canvas><span class="sr-only" data-demo-status aria-live="polite"></span><p class="playground__hint"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>click two nodes to toggle an edge · arrows + Enter also work</p></div>
      <div class="demo__stats mono"><span><i data-out-max>Maximal ✓</i></span><span>n <b data-out-n>—</b></span><span>|E| <b data-out-e>—</b></span><span>|M*| <b data-out-m>—</b></span><span>repair <b data-out-scan>—</b></span><span class="demo__tick" data-out-tick>0000 updates</span></div>
      <div class="playground__legend"><span><strong>M*</strong> current matching</span><span><strong>repair</strong> work after the last update</span><span><strong>Maximal</strong> every edge remains covered</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="playground__explain">
      <div><span class="mono">01</span><h2>Edges change</h2><p>Updates arrive one at a time, just as they do through <code>insert</code> and <code>delete</code>.</p></div>
      <div><span class="mono">02</span><h2>Local repair</h2><p>The matching responds to the affected neighborhood rather than rebuilding the story from scratch.</p></div>
      <div><span class="mono">03</span><h2>Maximality holds</h2><p>Every accepted state remains a matching with no uncovered edge that can be added safely.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .playground { padding-block: clamp(54px, 8vw, 100px) 40px; }
  .playground__header { max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 42px; }
  .playground__header h1 { margin: 24px 0 16px; font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 78px); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .playground__header p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 660px; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .playground__demo { overflow: hidden; background: var(--glass); }
  .playground__toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 16px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .playground__controls { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .playground__controls button, .demo__modes button { padding: 8px 11px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 13px; }
  .playground__controls button:hover, .demo__modes button:hover, .demo__modes button.is-on { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--line-strong); background: var(--surface-2); }
  .playground__canvas-wrap { position: relative; min-height: 520px; }
  .playground__canvas-wrap canvas { width: 100%; height: 520px; }
  .playground__hint { position: absolute; left: 22px; bottom: 16px; margin: 0; color: var(--ink-faint); font: 12px var(--font-mono); }
  .playground__hint .dot { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; margin-right: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mint); }
  .playground__legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 18px; padding: 10px 18px 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--ink-faint); font: 11px/1.45 var(--font-sans); }
  .playground__legend strong { color: var(--ink-dim); font-weight: 650; }
  .playground__explain { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin-top: 44px; }
  .playground__explain > div { padding-top: 18px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .playground__explain .mono { color: var(--cobalt); font-size: 12px; }
  .playground__explain h2 { margin: 14px 0 8px; font-size: 20px; }
  .playground__explain p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-dim); line-height: 1.65; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .playground__toolbar { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } .playground__canvas-wrap, .playground__canvas-wrap canvas { min-height: 380px; height: 380px; } .playground__hint { font-size: 10px; } .playground__explain { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
<script>
  import { initDemo } from "../scripts/demo";
  const host = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>("[data-demo]");
  if (host) initDemo(host);
</script>
